{
  "title": "Route 53 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "도메인 이름을 서비스 주소와 연결하고 DNS 응답 방식을 관리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Route 53</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#guide-1\">도메인과 레코드 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#guide-2\">요구에 맞는 라우팅 정책</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>42 / 62</span></div><h1>Route 53</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Route 53은 <strong>도메인 이름을 사용자가 접속할 서비스 주소와 연결하는 DNS<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 서비스</strong>입니다. <code>www.example.com</code>으로 요청하면 어떤 서버나 AWS 서비스에 연결할지 DNS 레코드로 알려줍니다.</p><p>단순히 주소 하나를 연결하는 것 외에도 가중치, 지연, 상태 확인 등을 기준으로 DNS 응답을 선택할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"hosted-zones-and-dns-records\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"alias-records\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"simple-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"weighted-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"latency-based-routing\"></span><h2>도메인과 레코드 구성</h2><p>호스팅 영역에 도메인의 레코드를 관리합니다. 인터넷에 공개할 DNS는 퍼블릭 호스팅 영역, VPC 내부의 이름 해석은 프라이빗 호스팅 영역을 사용합니다.</p><p>Alias 레코드로 CloudFront나 로드 밸런서 같은 지원 AWS 리소스를 연결할 수 있습니다. 도메인 등록, DNS 레코드 관리, 실제 서버 운영은 서로 다른 역할입니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"failover-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"geolocation-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"geoproximity-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ip-based-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"multivalue-answer-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"health-checks-and-resolver\"></span><h2>요구에 맞는 라우팅 정책</h2><p><strong>가중치 기반</strong>은 응답 비율을 나누는 데, <strong>지연 기반</strong>은 사용자에게 낮은 지연을 제공할 리전을 선택하는 데 사용합니다. <strong>장애 조치</strong>는 상태 확인을 바탕으로 주 대상과 보조 대상을 구분합니다.</p><p>DNS 응답은 클라이언트와 중간 DNS 서버에서 캐시될 수 있습니다. 레코드를 변경하거나 장애가 감지됐다고 모든 기존 연결이 즉시 바뀌는 것은 아니므로 TTL과 애플리케이션의 재연결을 고려합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>도메인으로 서비스 찾기</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>도메인 조회</strong><span>사용자가 주소 입력</span></li><li><strong>Route 53 응답</strong><span>정책에 맞는 대상 안내</span></li><li><strong>서비스에 연결</strong><span>브라우저가 대상에 접속</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">Route 53은 DNS로 접속 대상을 알려주며 웹 요청 자체를 대신 처리하지는 않습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>새 버전의 서비스로 일부 사용자를 먼저 보내기 위해 두 대상에 가중치를 설정합니다. 지표를 확인하며 새 버전의 응답 비중을 점차 늘립니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>DNS</strong> — 도메인 이름에 연결된 주소 등의 레코드를 조회하는 시스템입니다. DNS의 응답을 받은 클라이언트가 실제 서비스에 연결합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/Route53/latest/DeveloperGuide/Welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Route 53? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q023\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q024\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q082\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q001\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,2\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q093\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">이전 용어 <b>Region</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">다음 용어 <b>Route Table</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
